p;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;34&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot;&amp;gt;3 Questions - Assumptions - Contradictions&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;105&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;16&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#506078&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Ahmed Ismail&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;line x1=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y1=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; x2=&amp;quot;1730&amp;quot; y2=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#2873e8&amp;quot; stroke-width=&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;180&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#2873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;QUESTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;215&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.1: Can a temporary regional director be stored as manager of more than one branch?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;250&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.3: Does an individual vehicle price override the category rate completely?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;285&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.7: Can the same real person be both an individual customer and a corporate authorized driver?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;320&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.10: Can loyalty points expire or be adjusted manually?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;355&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.12: Is the receiving agent required later when the car is still out?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;390&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.16: Can one payment cover multiple rentals other than a corporate invoice?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;445&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#2873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;ASSUMPTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;480&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Branch manager is represented by Branch.ManagerID; employee belongs to one branch.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;515&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Current vehicle status and loyalty balance/tier are derived from history entries.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;550&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Rate ValidTo is NULL for the current rate; date ranges must not overlap.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;585&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Reservation promo use count is derived from reservations.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;620&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Rental stores price snapshots used to reproduce the invoice.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;655&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Only individual customers have loyalty accounts.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;710&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#2873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;CONTRADICTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;745&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.1 says one manager runs only one branch, but a regional director may temporarily replace a manager; the exception needs clarification.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;780&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.7 says every customer is exactly individual or corporate, while interview notes say a corporate driver may also be an individual customer.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;803&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;These are separate roles, not one customer subtype row.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/svg&amp;gt;" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,&amp;lt;svg xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 1800 1300&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;white&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;65&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;34&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot;&amp;gt;3 Questions - Assumptions - Contradictions&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;105&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;16&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23506078&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Ahmed Ismail&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;line x1=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y1=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; x2=&amp;quot;1730&amp;quot; y2=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%232873e8&amp;quot; stroke-width=&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;180&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%232873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;QUESTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;215&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.1: Can a temporary regional director be stored as manager of more than one branch?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;250&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.3: Does an individual vehicle price override the category rate completely?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;285&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.7: Can the same real person be both an individual customer and a corporate authorized driver?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;320&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.10: Can loyalty points expire or be adjusted manually?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;355&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.12: Is the receiving agent required later when the car is still out?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;390&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.16: Can one payment cover multiple rentals other than a corporate invoice?&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;445&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%232873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;ASSUMPTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;480&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Branch manager is represented by Branch.ManagerID; employee belongs to one branch.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;515&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Current vehicle status and loyalty balance/tier are derived from history entries.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;550&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Rate ValidTo is NULL for the current rate; date ranges must not overlap.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;585&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Reservation promo use count is derived from reservations.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;620&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Rental stores price snapshots used to reproduce the invoice.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;655&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• Only individual customers have loyalty accounts.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;80&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;710&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;25&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%232873e8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;CONTRADICTIONS&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;745&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.1 says one manager runs only one branch, but a regional director may temporarily replace a manager; the exception needs clarification.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;780&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;• 7.7 says every customer is exactly individual or corporate, while interview notes say a corporate driver may also be an individual customer.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;100&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;803&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;These are separate roles, not one customer subtype row.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/svg&amp;gt;" vertex="1" parent="1"&gt;&lt;mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1800" height="1300" as="geometry" /&gt;&lt;/mxCell&gt;&lt;/root&gt;&lt;/mxGraphModel&gt;</diagram><diagram id="p13" name="4-Business-Rules">&lt;mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1300" grid="1" page="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1300"&gt;&lt;root&gt;&lt;mxCell id="0" /&gt;&lt;mxCell id="1" parent="0" /&gt;&lt;mxCell id="2" value="&amp;lt;svg xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 1800 1300&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;white&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;65&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;34&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot;&amp;gt;4 Business Rules Beyond Constraints&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;105&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;16&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#506078&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Ahmed Ismail&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;line x1=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y1=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; x2=&amp;quot;1730&amp;quot; y2=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#2873e8&amp;quot; stroke-width=&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;135&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;165&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;1 | 7.3 Pricing | Rate validity periods for the same category or vehicle must never overlap. | A row CHECK cannot inspect other rows. | Use a&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;188&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;transaction/stored procedure (or exclusion constraint in PostgreSQL) to reject overlapping periods.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;300&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;330&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;2 | 7.6 Transfers | Arrival odometer must not be lower than the vehicle&amp;amp;#x27;s last recorded odometer, and arrival branch becomes its current location. |&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;353&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Requires reading history and updating related state. | Use one transfer-completion stored procedure in a transaction.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;465&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;495&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;3 | 7.9 Promotions | Promo usage cannot exceed MaxUses and it must be valid at reservation time. | Depends on PROMO plus all reservation rows. |&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;518&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Validate and increment atomically in application logic/stored procedure.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;630&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;660&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;4 | 7.10 Loyalty | Points balance may not become negative and tier must reflect the complete ledger. | Aggregate across many ledger rows. | Post&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;683&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;entries through a stored procedure; calculate balance/tier from the ledger.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;795&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;825&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;5 | 7.12 Rentals | A rental extension is a new rental linked in a chain; no agreement can have two direct extensions. | UNIQUE prevents two children&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;848&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;but cannot prevent cycles or invalid chain dates. | Trigger/procedure checks acyclic chain and consecutive dates.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;960&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;#9bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;990&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;6 | 7.15 Maintenance | At most one job card may be linked to a damage report. | Composite optional reference and cross-row rule. | Use a filtered&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;1013&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;#17233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;UNIQUE index plus transaction logic.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/svg&amp;gt;" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,&amp;lt;svg xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 1800 1300&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect width=&amp;quot;1800&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1300&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;white&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;65&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;34&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;bold&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot;&amp;gt;4 Business Rules Beyond Constraints&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;105&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;16&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23506078&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Ahmed Ismail&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;line x1=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y1=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; x2=&amp;quot;1730&amp;quot; y2=&amp;quot;125&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%232873e8&amp;quot; stroke-width=&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;135&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%239bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;165&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;1 | 7.3 Pricing | Rate validity periods for the same category or vehicle must never overlap. | A row CHECK cannot inspect other rows. | Use a&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;188&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;transaction/stored procedure (or exclusion constraint in PostgreSQL) to reject overlapping periods.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;300&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%239bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;330&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;2 | 7.6 Transfers | Arrival odometer must not be lower than the vehicle&amp;amp;%23x27;s last recorded odometer, and arrival branch becomes its current location. |&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;353&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Requires reading history and updating related state. | Use one transfer-completion stored procedure in a transaction.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;465&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%239bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;495&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;3 | 7.9 Promotions | Promo usage cannot exceed MaxUses and it must be valid at reservation time. | Depends on PROMO plus all reservation rows. |&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;518&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Validate and increment atomically in application logic/stored procedure.&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;rect x=&amp;quot;70&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;630&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;1660&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;145&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%23f8fbff&amp;quot; stroke=&amp;quot;%239bb8e8&amp;quot;/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text x=&amp;quot;90&amp;quot; y=&amp;quot;660&amp;quot; font-family=&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot; font-size=&amp;quot;17&amp;quot; fill=&amp;quot;%2317233f&amp;quot; font-weight=&amp;quot;normal&amp;quot;&amp;gt;4 | 7.10 Loyalty | Points balance may not become negative and tier must reflect the complete ledger. | Aggregate across many ledger rows. | Post&amp;lt;/text&amp;gt;&amp;lt;text 